APBureauEtude  (github.com/APBureauEtude)
    OBJ and MTL files read and written as UTF-8 on every platform (#523).

SebWell  (github.com/SebWell)
    The macOS package no longer bundles the Linux dwg2dxf (#515).

BlackFlash73  (github.com/blackflash73)
    RGBA face colours no longer break GLB, DAE and OBJ export (#462).

borborborja  (github.com/borborborja)
    Documents with textual curve IDs open again (#659).

lelopes05  (github.com/lelopes05)
    Malformed extension value labels guarded (#413).

PINYO PATTANAWASANPORN  (github.com/PINYOPATTANAWASANPORN)
    The base-map fix that stopped the program closing on Windows with AMD
    graphics (#327), from their own fork.

jonson7777  (github.com/jonson7777)
    Bug reports and requests from daily use: Push/Pull keeping internal
    faces, Offset's measurement box, toolbars and the sidebars.

tomlai-git  (github.com/tomlai-git)
    Reports on installation, the extension manager, keyboard shortcuts and
